      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفِيجَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A bow</i> (S, K) <i>made of a piece of wood
of the kind of tree called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبْع</span>; not known by Aboo-Sa'eed with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span> [in the place of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ج</span>]. (S [so in the
copies of that work which I am using, three in
number: but in one copy, “ except with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span> ”].)

